OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GThe RTV Slovenia Symphony
OL,6,     GOrchestra plays Bach and Mozart's
OL,7,     G'Jupiter' Symphony. Organist
OL,8,     GOlivier Latry and timpanist Petra
OL,9,     GVidmar join the ensemble for
OL,10,     GPoulenc's concerto.
